title: "Nicotiana breeding-genomics analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the manuscript describing literature mining, genome
  assembly quality assessment, functional annotation, gene-ID conversion,
  RNA-seq quantification and sgRNA design workflows for Nicotiana
  (tobacco) breeding.
